= Qualitative Feedback
As the Digital Literacy & AI Integration Workshop is scheduled for November 2026, qualitative feedback from participants has not yet been collected. Future impact reports will include post-training assessments, participant testimonials, and evaluations of practical AI integration in their respective classrooms.

= Conclusion
The registration data for the "Digital Literacy & AI Integration Workshop" demonstrates a strong initial interest from various educational institutions. The diverse participation base indicates that the CLEC Project is well-positioned to make a significant impact on digital literacy and AI integration in the region. Upon completion of the workshop, a follow-up assessment will be conducted to measure the practical outcomes and overall effectiveness of the training.